Weights and label order unchanged. Input float32 NHWC 1x320x320x3, 0–255. Centre square, resize to at most 448, resize 366, centre crop 320. Browser canvas resampling approximates the author's Pillow filters; output scores may differ. Browser image decoder handles EXIF orientation. No location masks applied.
The app displays the scientific name and top three candidates. High confidence does not establish that the image is a plant. The 0.70 score / 0.25 margin thresholds are heuristics, not calibrated guarantees.
