PRIVACY AND OFFLINE USE
All photo decoding, inference, records and exports run in the browser. No inference API, analytics or external runtime/CDN is used. Explicit reference links open external sources and require internet. The hosted site's initial sign-in / download requires a connection. Offline ZIP includes models and runtimes. Launch via local Python 3 static server; no pip installation or online setup is needed if Python 3 is already installed. Download and setup happen before going offline.
Browser cache preparation is optional and may be unavailable or evicted. Keep the complete downloaded folder. Hosted and localhost storage are separate; transfer records using JSON backups. Photos and notes remain on the device unless you export or share them.

VALIDATION LIMITS
Browser smoke tests establish that real models execute and records save. The test tomato leaf came from PlantVillage and may overlap training data; its result is not independent accuracy evidence. Original proposal accuracy, latency on Raspberry Pi, INT8 size and battery targets remain unverified. This integration does not include lesion segmentation, severity estimation, sensors or hardware.


