Input: RGB 0..1, centre square resized to 256x256, NCHW. Browser canvas resizing is an approximation of the reference bilinear resize.
Gate uses maximum cosine similarity in leaf, other-plant, nonplant groups. Accept when leaf similarity >=0.23 and margin over other groups >=0.025. These are prototype settings, not calibrated probabilities.
Quantized vision weights failed the initial smoke test; FP16 vision weights are shipped instead.
A five-image integration regression set includes 2 PlantVillage leaf images, a Wikimedia laptop photo, and synthetic blank/green images. This small set cannot establish field accuracy.
No real Raspberry Pi hardware, sensor or actuator has been tested. Hardware views and humidity values are simulation.
Care references: University of Minnesota Extension early blight, late blight, bacterial spot, tomato viruses and leaf spot guidance. URLs are included on each offline reference plan.
